{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだのデートのお相手は...\nさゆりん、まいまい\nせいらりん、ろってぃ\nでした〜〜(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン終わってから\nみんなでイルミネーション\n見に行ったよ♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しんけん寒くて\n長い時間居れんかったけど\nめっっちゃ綺麗で\n癒されました(*´｀*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/05/img_1623.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イルミネーション\n街のあちこちでよく\n見かけるようになったけど\n見るたび立ち止まってしまう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうクリスマスか〜〜\nう〜ん、早いなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらすぐ年越し、、\nそして誕生日、、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１年はあっとゆう間に\n過ぎていくなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさもとうとう\n来年は19歳なのか(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ気持ちは15歳。\nえ、それは無理ある？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日はせいたんと\nご飯食べに行ったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらと居ると\n大分弁、炸裂"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜〜っち思っちょったんやけどせいらはどう思っちょん？\nそうっちゃそうっちゃ(･∀･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人で ちゃっちゃ言ってる笑\n大分大好きな2人やもん(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに焼き肉食べて\n服見に行ったりしたよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったね(=゜ω゜)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして！\n乃木坂って、どこ？\nみなさん見てくれましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/happy02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は、田舎もんは誰だ！\n大分出身ということで\nクイズに参戦しましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/good.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二子玉川の呼び方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に　こ　た　ま。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな知ってた？\n分からんくない(>_<｡)？\n東京の人はみんな\n知っちょんのかなぁ〜。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！！！！\nもうこれで勉強になったので\n忘れません(=゜ω゜)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑\nひとつ成長。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週もぜひ見てくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/05/img_9004.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、ファンレター\n読ませて頂きました…！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれも全部\n胸にジーンと響いて……。\n本当にありがとうございました(/_;)\n嬉しい、本当に。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーはみんな可愛くて\nそれぞれ個性やキャラがあって\nその中でみさは\n何が輝いているんだろう。って\n悩んで考えるときがあります。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けどみなさんの言葉を見ていると\nそんなこと\n考えなくていいんだ。\nそのままで\nみさらしく居ればいいんだ。\nって思いました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん！\nこれからも努力することに\n変わりはありません！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくださる方の言葉が\n存在が、みさの力の源です！\nみなさんが居るから\n頑張ろうって思えます！\n本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ出会って少しだけれど\nまだまだこれからですよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもっともっと\nイベントや握手会\nこのブログのコメントを通して\nみなさんと関わっていきたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/wink.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、おやすみなさい(*^-^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いんで暖まってね〜〜。"}],"source":"archive"}